{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .mcp.json and replace every <...> with a real path.",
    ".mcp.json itself is gitignored: it names one machine's layout,",
    "and two of these servers live outside this repository.",
    "",
    "ghidra     the bridge to a running Ghidra. GHIDRA_MCP_URL MUST",
    "           be the port this project's server is on - a write",
    "           against another project's database corrupts it, and",
    "           the variable overrides the bridge's own discovery.",
    "           tools/gq.py addresses the port directly and refuses",
    "           any project but 64k_demos; prefer it. CLAUDE.md 2.1.",
    "dos-dbg    the DOSBox debugger bridge. Outside this repo.",
    "64k-demo-dbg   the port's own debug agent - tools/agent/,",
    "           docs/agent.txt. The only one that lives in here."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "ghidra": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<path to python.exe>",
      "args": [
        "<path to bridge_mcp_ghidra.py>"
      ],
      "env": {
        "GHIDRA_MCP_URL": "http://127.0.0.1:8090/",
        "GHIDRA_MCP_REQUIRE_PROGRAM_SELECTORS": "all"
      }
    },
    "dos-dbg": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<path to python.exe>",
      "args": [
        "<path to the DOSBox debugger mcp_server.py>"
      ]
    },
    "64k-demo-dbg": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<path to python.exe>",
      "args": [
        "<path to this repo>/tools/agent/mcp_server.py"
      ]
    }
  }
}
